# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# .NET build artifacts (nunca versionar bin/obj — contêm segredos/assemblys)
bin/
obj/
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/

# dependencies
/node_modules
/.pnp
.pnp.*
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/versions

# testing
/coverage

# next.js
/.next/
/out/

# production
/build

# misc
.DS_Store

# debug
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# env files (can opt-in for committing if needed)
.env*

# vercel
.vercel

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

firestore.rules
test-parser.js
DEPLOY-VPS.md

# =============================================================================
# SEGREDOS / CREDENCIAIS — nunca commitar
# =============================================================================
secrets/
# .NET User Secrets (config segura de desenvolvimento local)
**/appsettings.Local.json
**/appsettings.*.local.json
# arquivos de env/secrets do backend (Docker/VM)
**/backend.env
**/.env
# certificados / chaves privadas
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
# arquivos de credencial de cloud/service account (Firebase, GCP)
*-firebase-adminsdk-*.json
*-service-account*.json
creds*.json
# dados sensíveis do banco local
**/teleprompt-dev.db
**/teleprompt.db

# banco SQLite do compose (volume ./,data) — só o diretório raiz /data
/data/
!/data/.gitkeep
